// A cave spider seen from above, pointing right: a bulbous abdomen with a
// red mark, a head with eight red eyes, fangs. The game turns it to where
// it goes and gives it legs (`legs` in its creature file; actors/legs.rs);
// `grip` is where the legs meet.
